---
import {progressChecks} from '../../lib/get-ready/report.mjs';
---
<section class="ink ready-progress" data-ready-progress aria-labelledby="progress-heading">
 <h2 id="progress-heading">Your setup progress.</h2>
 <p>After a check, your agent can give you a redacted progress report. Open it here to see what passed and what needs attention.</p>
 <label>Open your agent’s report<input data-progress-file type="file" disabled accept="application/json,.json" aria-describedby="progress-privacy"/></label>
 <p id="progress-privacy" class="small">Read on this device; never uploaded. Use the report your agent exports, not its private <code>readiness.json</code> file.</p>
 <noscript><p class="small">This progress viewer needs JavaScript. Your agent can read the report and give you the results directly.</p></noscript>
 <p data-progress-message class="message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
 <p data-progress-overview class="note">No report loaded.</p>
 <ol data-progress-checks class="progress-checks">{Object.values(progressChecks).map(check=><li><h3>{check.label}</h3><span class="small">Not checked here</span><p class="small">{check.help}</p></li>)}</ol>
 <div data-progress-operations hidden></div>
 <p data-progress-disclaimer hidden class="small">This is a dated agent report, not a live check. Recheck after changing your environment. This report grants no access or permission to build or deploy.</p>
 <div class="actions" data-progress-actions hidden><a class="button secondary" href="/ready?task=check#agent-start">Check again with your agent</a><button class="secondary" data-clear-progress type="button">Clear report</button></div>
</section>
<style>
 .ready-progress h2{max-width:20ch}.progress-checks{padding-left:24px;margin:24px 0}.progress-checks :global(li){padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);margin:0}.progress-checks :global(h3){font-size:1.15rem;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 6px}.progress-checks :global(p){margin:8px 0}.ready-progress .actions{gap:12px;margin-bottom:0}.ready-progress input{max-width:100%}.ready-progress :global(.pass){color:var(--color-success)}.ready-progress :global(.needs-attention){color:var(--color-accent)}
</style>
<script src="../lib/ready-progress-client.ts"></script>
